# secops-guard - npm supply-chain cooldown
# Requires npm >= 11.10.0 (check with `npm -v`). Older npm silently ignores the key
# and `npm config set min-release-age` errors out, so the installer skips it instead.
# Unit: DAYS. Conflicts with the `before` key - never set both.
# Exempt specific packages with min-release-age-exclude (globs, npm >= 11.17.0).
# Env equivalent: NPM_CONFIG_MIN_RELEASE_AGE
min-release-age=@DAYS@
